      "side": 1,
      "message": "Dan - the implicit proposal here is for Soong\u0027s genrule and cc_genrule to both map to Bazel\u0027s genrule. Can you see a reason not to do that? \n\nAsking because I think you added cc_genrule to Soong and I\u0027m not sure why it was necessary",
      "revId": "cff27930ad1086edc0319a6265f95e16faf10ad5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
